Come on, soldier. Hoods up!

545
00:36:44.730 --> 00:36:46.320
What the hell?

546
00:36:56.470 --> 00:36:58.570
Suck on this, bird brain!

547
00:37:07.720 --> 00:37:09.410
Go away, sucker!

548
