Jeez.

708
00:49:12.980 --> 00:49:15.210
Dr. Ferezze!

709
00:49:15.280 --> 00:49:16.340
Hart, no!

710
00:49:16.350 --> 00:49:19.370
Back here! Don't follow stupid with stupid.

711
00:49:28.730 --> 00:49:30.450
Dr. Ferezze!

