The generator's in the hangar, right?

752
00:51:58.370 --> 00:52:01.670
Yeah. Triple-phase power, 63-amp cables.

753
00:52:01.680 --> 00:52:03.270
According to these blueprints,

754
00:52:03.280 --> 00:52:05.300
